{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":37668047,"ns":0,"title":"Arithmetico-geometric sequence","extract":"In mathematics, an arithmetico-geometric sequence is the result of element-by-element multiplication of the elements of a geometric progression with the corresponding elements of an arithmetic progression. The nth element of an arithmetico-geometric sequence is the product of the nth element of an arithmetic sequence and the nth element of a geometric sequence.","description":"Mathematical sequence satisfying a specific pattern","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}